  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A major search and rescue operation is currently underway at an illegal gold mining site in Pongkor, Bogor, following a fatal flooding incident. Initial reports indicated thirteen fatalities, but current coverage confirms sixteen deaths as rescue teams work under challenging conditions. Efforts to locate missing miners have been frequently interrupted by heavy rain, which has forced authorities to halt site access to ensure the safety of emergency personnel. In addition to the search operations, the police are conducting a broader criminal investigation into unlicensed mining activities, specifically focusing on reports of illegal gold processing linked to operations within the Mount Halimun Salak National Park region. The ongoing incident highlights significant safety and legal issues regarding unauthorized extraction activities in the area, prompting active scrutiny from law enforcement and regional authorities.",
